{% if termsReadOnly %}
    <p class="govuk-body">You must read and agree to these requirements and principles for the acceptable use of HMPPS Digital Services.</p>
{% else %}
    <p class="govuk-body">You must confirm that you have read and understood these requirements and principles for the acceptable use of HMPPS Digital Services.</p>
{% endif %}
    <p class="govuk-body">These requirements apply to your use of your user account and access to HMPPS Digital Services. They apply to all users, including:</p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>Ministry of Justice (MOJ) and HMPPS employees, contractors, consultants, and temporary staff</li>
      <li>staff from other agencies, such as the Police</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="govuk-body">Please check this statement regularly. It may be updated from time to time. You can find the statement in the footer of Digital Prison Services (DPS) and again in the footer when you next log in.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">HMPPS Digital Services contain sensitive information. By using HMPPS Digital Services, you confirm that you have read and understood the following requirements and principles.</p>
